  "howItWorks": "A city built around big ideas.\n\nEvery sign has a story. Yours could be next.\n\n01\nFind a little corner.\n\nExplore buildings, the landmark, buses, and one drone. Tap a sign to see who lives there this week.\n\n02\nMake an entrance.\n\nEvery sign in Founders Square can hold an idea for seven days at a published rate. Empty corners stay empty until someone takes them.\n\n03\nKeep your place in the skyline.\n\nLeave Opportunity.city on a second screen. Listen, look up when you want, and visit a neighbor when something catches your eye.\n\nA good neighborhood for everyone.\n\nAd text and artwork must be suitable for a general audience. Uploaded logos are sent to Sightengine for automated checks before publishing. Questions or a mistaken rejection? Contact contact@opportunity.city.\n\nAbout\nRules\nContact & imprint\nPrivacy\nPrivacy choices\nBrowse the city\nClose",
